# Product scopes accepted by .agents/hooks/commit-msg, one per line. Blank
# lines and `#` comment lines are ignored. A trailing comment on a scope line
# is not: the hook compares the whole trimmed line, so `dev  # ...` would stop
# matching `dev`.
#
# The process scopes are built into the hook and need no entry here: proposal,
# policy, decision, guides, docs, tools, ci, agents, skills, rules, templates,
# hooks, mise, readme, vision, treewide. Neither does a real
# proposals/<NNNN>-<slug>.md filename, used as `0007-export-queue: ...`.

